# =================================================================
# ABox Instances extracted from:
#   Government Resolution No. 501
#   Amending Government Resolution No. 818 (Cybersecurity Law
#   Implementation) – Secure State Data Transmission Network
#   users list changes
#   2026-06-23, Vilnius
#   Acting PM Inga Ruginienė
# =================================================================

lld:GovRes-501-2026 a llo:Statute ;
    rdfs:label "Government Resolution No. 501 – Amendment of Resolution No. 818: Secure Network users list changes (2026)" ;
    rdfs:label "Government Resolution No. 501 – Amendment of Resolution No. 818: Secure Network users list changes (2026)"@en ;
    rdfs:label "Vyriausybės nutarimas Nr. 501 – Nutarimo Nr. 818 pakeitimas: Saugiojo tinklo naudotojų sąrašo pakeitimai (2026)"@lt ;
    rdfs:comment "Amends the Secure State Data Transmission Network (Saugusis valstybinis duomenų perdavimo tinklas) users list approved by Government Resolution No. 818 of 2018-08-13: removes points 72 and 94, adds new points 356¹ and 445¹. Phased entry into force: points 1.1 (removal of point 72) and 1.4 (addition of point 445¹) effective immediately; points 1.2 (removal of point 94) and 1.3 (addition of point 356¹) effective 2027-01-01. Acting PM Inga Ruginienė, Acting Defence Minister Robertas Kaunas." ;
    rdfs:comment "Amends the Secure State Data Transmission Network (Saugusis valstybinis duomenų perdavimo tinklas) users list approved by Government Resolution No. 818 of 2018-08-13: removes points 72 and 94, adds new points 356¹ and 445¹. Phased entry into force: points 1.1 (removal of point 72) and 1.4 (addition of point 445¹) effective immediately; points 1.2 (removal of point 94) and 1.3 (addition of point 356¹) effective 2027-01-01. Acting PM Inga Ruginienė, Acting Defence Minister Robertas Kaunas."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Keičia Saugiojo valstybinio duomenų perdavimo tinklo naudotojų sąrašą, patvirtintą Vyriausybės 2018-08-13 nutarimu Nr. 818: panaikina 72 ir 94 punktus, prideda naujus 356¹ ir 445¹ punktus. Etapinis įsigaliojimas: 1.1 ir 1.4 papunkčiai iš karto; 1.2 ir 1.3 papunkčiai nuo 2027-01-01. Laikinai einanti MP pareigas Inga Ruginienė, laikinai einantis KAM ministro pareigas Robertas Kaunas."@lt ;
    llo:hasDocID "No. 501" ;
    llo:dateEnacted "2026-06-23"^^xsd:date ;
    llo:isPubliclyDisclosed true .
